ing-slide checks, and alternatives that did not support the same diagnosis."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/job-talk-field-guide/source-exploration.md","download":true,"children":"Read the search and selection notes ↓"}]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Working files"}],["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"/job-talk-field-guide/project-plan.md","download":true,"children":"Initial project plan ↓"}],["$","br",null,{}],["$","a",null,{"href":"/job-talk-field-guide/gallery-data.json","download":true,"children":"Editable case content ↓"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"source-list","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Public decks"}],[["$","article","https://www.brookings.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/6a_ADH-BPEA-Slides-Final.pdf",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"On the Persistence of the China Shock"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["David Autor, David Dorn, Gordon Hanson"," · ","2021-09-09"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","href":"https://www.brookings.edu/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/6a_ADH-BPEA-Slides-Final.pdf","children":"Original PDF ↗"}]]}],["$","article","https://www.cirje.e.u-tokyo.ac.jp/research/workshops/macro/macropaper10/macro0622slides.pdf",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Financial Intermediation and Credit Policy"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Mark Gertler and Nobuhiro Kiyotaki"," · ","2010-06-22"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","href":"https://www.cirje.e.u-tokyo.ac.jp/research/workshops/macro/macropaper10/macro0622slides.pdf","children":"Original PDF ↗"}]]}],["$","article","https://www.yjs.fi/wp-content/uploads/daron-acemoglu_robots-and-jobs_part-1.pdf",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Robots and Jobs"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Daron Acemoglu, Pascual Restrepo"," · ","2019-04"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"text-link","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","href":"https://www.yjs.fi/wp-content/uploa